Sets the [`MakeWriter`] that the subscriber being built will use to write events.

# Examples

Using `stderr` rather than `stdout`:

```rust
use tracing_subscriber::fmt;
use std::io;

fmt()
    .with_writer(io::stderr)
    .init();
```
